# Written 2026-11-24 from the April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# fisher-8ie rules 1, 2, 5 and 8, D24 and D41.
# The two positions, sole moves and four-ply values come from go-parameters.uci.
> position fen 7k/8/5K1Q/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go infinite
< info depth 4 multipv 1 score mate -1 nodes 782 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
> isready
< readyok
# Send all three commands without waiting for a response between them.
> stop
> position fen 7k/8/5K2/6Q1/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go
< bestmove h8g8
< info depth 4 multipv 1 score mate -1 nodes 1299 nps {nps} time {time} pv {pv}
# The only legal move in the accepted replacement position is h8h7.
< bestmove {legal}
> quit
! exit
